## Previously raised findings (review-round registry)

These defects were raised on earlier review rounds of this PR. For each finding below: verify fixed (cite the fixing hunk), withdraw (reason required), or mark re-introduced. New claims need new evidence — a claim already on this list is answered, not re-raised.

| id | status | severity | file | claim |
|----|--------|----------|------|-------|
| F1 | open | BLOCKING | README.md | 🚨 blocking ci red — docs freshness fails on head c4f246da stale generated docs the pr adds two new customparams keys to the dev leg s config surface js developticketandcreatepr js → initdevelopmentcontext so the agent doc generator s output changes — but the regenerated docs are not committed ci failed run https github com istin dmtools agents actions runs 42989719055 job 130419330438 error docs agents generated or snapshots is stale run node js agentdocgenerator js node generate agent snapshots js and commit the result reproduced locally on the pr head — the generator diff is exactly three files byte identical to ci s failure diff text docs agents generated bug development md 4 docs agents generated story development md 4 docs agents generated story development dynamic repo md 4 the entries are correct content not generator noise the knob is genuinely read by the bug dev leg too js developbugandcreatepr js 870 delegates into developticket action params → initdevelopmentcontext → applydevelopmentmode and story development dynamic repo json inherits the same action through its parent story development json fix no code change needed — regen commit bash node js agentdocgenerator js node generate agent snapshots js git add docs agents generated snapshots git commit m gh 1435 regenerate agent docs for the developmentmode knob verification note the unit suite is green on this head — dmtools run js unit tests run developmentmode json 36 36 pass and the full run all json under the ci node harness 9638 passed 0 failed docs freshness is the only red check fixing it unblocks merge |
| F2 | open | SUGGESTION | README.md | 💡 sugestion readme documents the knob for one leg — it is live on three this section says the story development leg story development json → developticketandcreatepr js reads an optional developmentmode knob and the last bullet says so other dev legs can adopt the knob without duplicating the logic — implying other legs have not adopted it yet in this pr they already have bug development — js developbugandcreatepr js 870 calls developticket action params which runs initdevelopmentcontext → applydevelopmentmode the knob is read on that leg today story development dynamic repo — the regenerated generated docs the ones ci requires you to commit list developmentmode developmentmodeconfig for this agent as well a deployer configuring bug development from the readme would conclude the knob does nothing for their leg while docs agents generated bug development md says it does suggested fix one sentence rides the same commit as the doc regeneration any leg whose action runs developticketandcreatepr js story bug and dynamic repo variants reads the knob — the same surface as customparams feedbackloop non blocking documentation surface clarity only |

### How to answer

Add a `findingReview` block to `outputs/pr_review.json` (alongside `inlineComments`):

```json
{"findingReview": {
  "dispositions": [
    {"n": 1, "status": "fixed", "hunk": "<file:lines \u2014 the fixing hunk>"},
    {"n": 2, "status": "withdrawn", "reason": "<why this is not a defect>"},
    {"n": 3, "status": "re-introduced"}
  ],
  "confirmations": [
    {"proposedFor": 1, "same": true}
  ]
}}
```

Unconfirmed candidates become new identities (the merge bias is confirm-only); a genuinely new finding on a resolved item is expected to be raised again with new evidence.

